key_patterns:
Codebase is heavily documented with rationale comments. Several 'false positive' lints already have explanatory comments nearby (e.g. GraduationGuard MAX_SEED_AMOUNT int128 bound at line 34; LaunchFactory _fullRangeTicks truncation comment). Setters in Doorway already emit events BEFORE assignment (setRelayer/setGuardian/setFee emit old->new). Suppression format required by the linter: place immediately above the flagged line:
    // <lint-name>: <specific reason this is safe>
    // forge-lint: disable-next-line(<lint-name>)
Use targeted per-line disables with a real justification - NEVER blanket-disable globally.
